<title>UK: BOE forecasts 750 mln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 750 mln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England forecast a liquidity shortage of around 750 million stg and invited an early round of outright bill offers in bands 1 and 2.</p>
<p>The bank also invited an unrestricted bill/fixed rate gilt repo to January 13.  </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
